    {
      "id": "p0255-b004",
      "kind": "quote",
      "source": {
        "text": "If Sans and I started a band, do you know what we could call it? \"Dreemurr\" and \"Femur.\" L-0-L! PS - That is only a joke. Do not refer to me as Dreenmrr",
        "raw": "If Sans and I started a band, do you know what we could call it?\n\"Dreemurr\" and \"Femur.\"\nL-0-L!\nPS - That is only a joke. Do not refer to me as Dreenmrr",
        "status": "corrected",
        "languages": [
          "en"
        ],
        "bbox": [
          0.13342619,
          0.28581429,
          0.61342958,
          0.35367857
        ],
        "mask_bbox": [
          0.13210674,
          0.2851,
          0.61474902,
          0.35475
        ],
        "line_ids": [
          22,
          23,
          24,
          25
        ]
      },
      "translation": {
        "text": "如果我和 Sans 组个乐队，你知道可以叫什么吗？“Dreemurr and Femur”（Dreemurr 与股骨）。笑—死—啦！附言：只是开玩笑。别叫我 Dreemurr。",
        "status": "draft",
        "spans": []
      },
      "annotations": [],
      "layout": {
