    {
      "id": "p0255-b005",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "source": {
        "text": "The joke here is that Toriel's last name, \"Dreemurr\", rhymes with \"Femur\", which is a type oflarge bone. This joke would be lost in a literal translation into Japanese, so the translator replaced it with something new:",
        "raw": "The joke here is that Toriel's last name, \"Dreemurr\", rhymes with \"Femur\",\nwhich is a type oflarge bone. This joke would be lost in a literal translation into\nJapanese, so the translator replaced it with something new:",
        "status": "corrected",
        "languages": [
          "en"
        ],
        "bbox": [
          0.09477664,
          0.36865714,
          0.70310099,
          0.41745
        ],
        "mask_bbox": [
          0.09274673,
          0.36794286,
          0.7051309,
          0.41852143
        ],
        "line_ids": [
          26,
          27,
          28
        ]
      },
      "translation": {
        "text": "笑点在于，Toriel 的姓 Dreemurr 和 femur（股骨，一种大骨头）押韵。直译成日文就没了笑点，因此译者换了个新笑话：",
        "status": "draft",
        "spans": []
      },
