    {
      "id": "p0255-b007",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "source": {
        "text": "The name \"CHITEI NO OWARI\" (\"End of the Underground\"), is a reference to \"SEKAI NO OWARI\" (\"End of the World\"), a Japanese band that achieved incredible popularity in the 2010s. In this way, the untranslatable joke of the original text was replaced with a comedic reference to a real-life band.",
        "raw": "The name \"CHITEI NO OWARI\" (\"End of the Underground\"), is a reference\nto \"SEKAI NO OWARI\" (\"End of the World\"), a Japanese band that achieved\nincredible popularity in the 2010s. In this way, the untranslatable joke of the\noriginal text was replaced with a comedic reference to a real-life band.",
        "status": "corrected",
        "languages": [
          "en"
        ],
        "bbox": [
          0.09519277,
          0.51534286,
          0.68470998,
          0.58302143
        ],
        "mask_bbox": [
          0.09274673,
          0.51462857,
          0.7051309,
          0.58409286
        ],
        "line_ids": [
          33,
          34,
          35,
          36
        ]
      },
      "translation": {
        "text": "“CHITEI NO OWARI”（地下世界的终结）是在致敬日本乐队“SEKAI NO OWARI”（世界末日）；这支乐队在 2010 年代大受欢迎。原本无法直译的笑话，就这样换成了对现实乐队的幽默引用。",
        "status": "draft",
        "spans": []
      },
      "annotations": [],
      "layout": {
        "bbox": [
          0.09498471,
          0.51391429,
          0.70310099,
          0.58659286
        ],
        "font_size": 20,
        "line_height": 1.45,
        "font_weight": 450,
        "background": "transparent",
        "text_align": "justify",
        "auto_height": true,
        "limit_bottom": 0.6757142857142857,
        "snap_to_guides": true,
        "resize_anchor": "left",
