    {
      "id": "p0255-b008",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "source": {
        "text": "This small change in this small line has resulted in an unexpected side effect: Japanese fans now associate Sans with being a DJ. So while English-speaking fans might draw Sans playing musical instruments as part of\"Dreemur and Femur\", Japanese fans often portray him as the DJ for \"CHITEI NO OWARI\".",
        "raw": "This small change in this small line has resulted in an unexpected side effect:\nJapanese fans now associate Sans with being a DJ. So while English-speaking\nfans might draw Sans playing musical instruments as part of\"Dreemur and\nFemur\", Japanese fans often portray him as the DJ for \"CHITEI NO OWARI\".",
        "status": "corrected",
        "languages": [
          "en"
        ],
        "bbox": [
          0.09477664,
          0.59762143,
          0.69369234,
          0.66596429
        ],
        "mask_bbox": [
          0.09274673,
          0.59690714,
          0.7051309,
          0.66703571
        ],
        "line_ids": [
          37,
          38,
          40,
          42
        ]
      },
      "translation": {
        "text": "这一小句里的小改动，产生了意想不到的影响：日本粉丝开始把 Sans 与 DJ 联系起来。因此，英语圈粉丝可能会画他作为“Dreemurr and Femur”的成员演奏乐器，日本粉丝却常把他画成“CHITEI NO OWARI”的 DJ。",
        "status": "draft",
        "spans": []
